Inference and speech engines
----------------------------

llama.cpp (the `llama-server` binary and its shared libraries)
  License: MIT
  Source:  https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp
  Pinned by packaging/fetch-llama-server.sh. Shipped in every desktop
  installer and CLI archive for which the pinned upstream release publishes a
  build.

whisper.cpp (compiled into the speech-to-text runners through the
`whisper-rs` and `whisper-rs-sys` crates)
  License: MIT (whisper.cpp), Unlicense (whisper-rs, whisper-rs-sys)
  Source:  https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp
  Pinned by Cargo.lock.

vllm-mlx (the MLX inference engine, macOS Apple Silicon packages only)
  License: Apache-2.0
  Source:  https://github.com/waybarrios/vllm-mlx
  Pinned by packaging/requirements-mlx-engine.txt, together with the part of
  its dependency closure listed under "MLX engine environment" below.


